<title>GERMANY: NordLB 10-mo operating profit down 15 pct.</title>
<headline>NordLB 10-mo operating profit down 15 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HANOVER, Germany</dateline>
<text>
<p>10 months to October 31</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Group oper profit after provisions    318.2  vs 375.7</p>
<p>    Group risk provisions		     290.0  vs 293.9</p>
<p>    Group oper profit before provisions   608.2  vs 669.6</p>
<p>    Group trading profit			32.0   vs 72.3</p>
<p>    Group net interest income		 1,411  vs 1,362</p>
<p>    Group net commission income	     206.2  vs 191.2</p>
<p>    Group administration expenses	   1,004  vs 912.6</p>
<p>    Group balance sheet total		 220,688 vs 208,941</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German regional bank is Norddeutsche Landesbank. Earnings and costs compare with first 10 months of 1995, balance sheet total compares end-October 1996 with end-December 1995.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
